<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Chuang's China shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Chuang's China shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of electronic products maker and property concern Chuang's China Investments Ltd was suspended shortly after the market opened at the company's request pending an annnouncement, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares were unchanged at HK$0.215 per share prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 130 million shares worth HK$26 million.</p>
<p>Its shares ended HK$0.006 or 2.87 percent up at HK$0.215 on Tuesday on volume of 2.79 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong KKong Newsroom (8952) 2843 6370</p>
